    <string name="help_title">Setup &amp; Optimization Guide</string>
    <string name="help_body">To ensure FocusGuard functions reliably without interruption:\n\n• Accessibility: Enable FocusGuard in Settings → Accessibility. If greyed out on Android 13+, open FocusGuard App Info → three dots (top-right) → Allow restricted settings.\n• Battery: Set FocusGuard battery usage to "Unrestricted" in App Info.\n• Autostart (Xiaomi / Poco / Oppo / Vivo): Allow Autostart and background activity in device settings.\n• Xiaomi Pop-up Windows: In FocusGuard App Info → Other permissions → Enable "Display pop-up windows while running in the background".</string>
